<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="1TI" style="id">1OTI - ELOYI TRANSLATION PROJECT</book>
  <para style="h">1 Otimoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Kwupu Ungwu Kwonze Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa OTIMOTI</para>
  <para style="toc2">1 Otimoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">1 Oti</para>
  <para style="mt2">Kwupu Ungwu Kwonze Ungwu Ɔpɔlu A Ka Laa</para>
  <para style="mt1">OTIMOTI</para>
  <para style="imt">Kambu Iyemo</para>
  <para style="ip">Otimoti akwu ulugbaga uwu a na rɛnu ingyi Okrasi iyepo bɛnɛ. E ngyi mu ɛzhi iyi Eshiya Omayino. Anyi wu akwu Ozhu ete wu ba akwu Ogiriki. Akwu mbwama uwu Ɔpɔlu mu ɛduma wu iyi anu itama iyi Ɔzhizɔsi. Kwupu kwɔlɛ kwu siso mu apula ɛla.</para>
  <para style="ip">Iso iyi kwonze akwu mekeka iyi ɛzu iyangba. Ɛzu iyangba ɛlɛ, i to ukwu uwu Azhu mbala uwu bɔkɔ akwu uwu Azhu mo akwɛyi i ngbɛ yi i lomesu, akwɛyi i zɔ tee, kwudu kwɔle kwu yi ira, onzu a fya isama mo bate e yi iyitu iyi invyemo loo, mbala i zɛ gboo mbaa apula irimo iyifo mbala oko itomo mbala Ɔnu iyama. Kwupu kwɔlɛ kwu kyo kwu yi okpa mekeka iyi o ra laa ɔshɔshi, mbala Ukpo ilɛma mu ɔshɔshi, mbala ari iyi bɔkɔ wa to keyi mbala enzu umba o wo ɛduma mu ɔshoshi lo yi yi. Imbwama yi o ta Otimoti amasa meka iyi ewo iyi e wo kaa la kwu umɛgba uwu esheshi uwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mbala ewo iyi a zɛ mbala uzhi uzhi uwu wambwalu mu ɔshɔshi.</para>
  <para style="iot">Iso Iyi I Yi Memi</para>
  <para style="io1">Kambu Iyemo (1.1-2)</para>
  <para style="io1">Okpa Meka Iyi Ɔshɔshi Mbala Enzu Umba Ɛduma (1.3—3.16)</para>
  <para style="io1">Okpa Laa Otimoti Meka Iyi Ɛduma Wu (4.1—6.21)</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="1TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 1:1" />Imi Ɔpɔlu mu inyama iyi Ukpo mi kwu uzilɔ uwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi usama nzu uwu bɔkɔ ki fulo eyi nzu mawu awu gba mi yi mu kwupu kwɔlɛ ikama ma le.<verse eid="1TI 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 1:2" />Kwupu kwɔlɛ mi ka mi ka ŋa Otimoti umɛ mi ureyi kwuwongu ŋɔ nyama la Ɔzhizɔsi :</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 1:2">Mi lɛ Edego-ala mbala Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi Ɔkwu nzu te la zɔ ŋɔ esheshi mbala eyembembyi wu kaa le shi ŋɔ egbo iyi oloto.<verse eid="1TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngbɛndu Mbaa Wa Zɔ Ɛzu Iyi Angba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 1:3" />Tabɔkɔ mi so ŋɔ kwuyengwu mi ŋi lu ŋɔ afyima kaa mi so mu ɛzhi iyi Omasedoniya awu tee, ŋɔma mu kwuse ungwu Ɛfɛsɔ kaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o zɔ ɛzu iyi angba awu za mba te lo zɔ ɛzu iyi angba ɛlɛ te fo <verse eid="1TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 1:4" />naa lo shi egbo mbo mbaa esepo iyi angba mbala ɛza iyi ɛdɔ iyi bɔkɔ i bɔma mo. Ɛlɛ i bo la kaambu irimo akwɛyi ɛduma iyi Ukpo iyi wa mbwalu oo wo i re keyi fo. <verse eid="1TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 1:5" />Uŋɔ so mbo iso ɛlɛ te kaa enzu lo gyesu la egbo iruwu, mu egbo ikpɛnyi mu ikwu idu fulo ongbulolo. <verse eid="1TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 1:6" />Umbafo o lafya la ɛlɛ akwɛyi o ba yi eza iyi bɔkɔ i yi kwuyi mo. <verse eid="1TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 1:7" />Umba o gyi te enzu lo yitu mba te umba akwu wa zɔ ɛrama iyi Omosisi, umba ba o zɔngɔma iyi bɔkɔ o yi mu enzu izɔma le mo naa iyi bɔkɔ umba o yi mu kwushi ibɔma te akwu inyi le mo.<verse eid="1TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 1:8" />Kinzu ki yitu te ɛrama iyi Ukpo i shoshi gba onzu a mbwalu yi marimari. <verse eid="1TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 1:9" />Kinzu ki gba ki yitu te Ukpo e bo la ɛrama ɛlɛ akwu kwuwongu enzu umba ototo mo, akwu kwuwongu enzu umba o towo iso iyi Ukpo imbwaluma mbala umba bɔkɔ o towo Ukpo mo mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o wo kyamate Ukpo e yi mo mbala enzu umba ingbomo, mbala umba akɔ iyira mbala umba bɔkɔ o lomo la Ukpo mo mbala umba bɔkɔ o ngbɛ umba ete mbo mbala umba anyi mba ma mbala wa ngbɛ enzu, <verse eid="1TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 1:10" />mbala enzu wa to kaya mbala anzɔnu wa nɔ mbala anzɔnu mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o to enzu o yama mbala wa mulo mbala wa zɔ izɔgɔ iyi angba mbala kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ ki zɛ kya mbala iso iyi Ukpo mo. <verse eid="1TI 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 1:11" />Iyi bɔkɔ i zɛ kya mbala ilɔ iyeshi iyi inzumbɛku iyi Edego-ala, iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a ra yi e lo mi mɔwu awu.<verse eid="1TI 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Gbɛlɛ Ukpo Ɛnyi Kwuwongwu Esheshi Wu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 1:12" />Mi gbɛlɛ Ɔkwu nzu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi ɛnyi, uwu e shi mi ekpasu, bɔkɔ a nyama la mi akwɛyi a ŋa mi te la mi wo wu ɛduma. <verse eid="1TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 1:13" />Mekyi mi kwu onzu uwu mi koko mi so iso iyira iyi Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala u lo wa mbwalu inyashi mbala onzu u wo ovyo, tetete Ukpo ba a ma eyembembyi mi kwuwongu kwuye kwɔngu mi wo yi mu iyitu mi mo ba mi nyama la Ɔzhizɔsi mo. <verse eid="1TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 1:14" />Ukpo a zɔ mi esheshi wu gyɔɔ akwɛyi e shi mi mi nyama la wu mbala idɛnyi ipwumo iyi enzu iyi bɔkɔ i yi mu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi.<verse eid="1TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 1:15" />Iso ɛlɛ akwu iso ongbulolo iyi i fa te uwewe la nyama la yi te: Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi e bo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ kaa la sa enzu umba ingbomo ma, imi ba ingbomo mi i ka iyi uwewe mo. <verse eid="1TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 1:16" />Akwu kwuwo kwɔlɛ gba Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi a ma eyembembyi mi le, kaa la ra mi, Imi onzu uwu ingbomo u ka le, la zɔ idu iyimo wu gyɔɔ mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o bo mbwalu wu kaa lo fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ. <verse eid="1TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 1:17" />Mi lɛ Edego-ala, Ɔsu uwɔkpɔɔ, uwu e yi iyɔkpɔ ba o ma wu mo, Ukpo ukpɛnyi, la fya iduma ma mbala inzumbɛku iyɔkpɔ ba ɔkpɔ. Li yi tayi,<verse eid="1TI 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 1:18" />Umɛ mi Otimoti, iso iyi mi so ŋɔ te kaa wo le i zɛ kya mbala iso iyi bɔkɔ anukenzu umba Ukpo o so mu reshi ŋɔ tayi, gba ŋɔ mbwalu yi, ŋɔ to ewa ɔnyɛnyɛ kyamate osozha uweshi, <verse eid="1TI 1:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 1:19" />uŋɔ koko kaa fulo egbo mu Ɔzhizɔsi mbala egbo sɛsɛ. Enzu umbafo o towo ɛlɛ ma akwɛyi i shi ikwu idu fulo mbo i kpɛdɔma. <verse eid="1TI 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 1:20" />Mekeka iyi enzu mbɔlɛ te gba akwu Amɛniyɔ mbala Alɛkizanda, enzu mbɔlɛ mi ra mba mi lo onzu uwoyi mɔwu kaa la zɔ mba kaa lo so iso iyira iyi Ukpo fo.<verse eid="1TI 1:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="1TI 2" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Zɔ Otimoti Ewo Iyi Ɔɔ LƐ Ukpo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 2:1" />Otimoti, iyi kwonze mi gyi te, la lu lɛ Ukpo iyɛkɔkɔ la enzu lɛɛbi akwɛyi la lu gbɛlɛ Ukpo ɛnyi kwuwongu uwewe. <verse eid="1TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 2:2" />La lu kyo la lu lɛ Ukpo kwuwongu asu mbala enzu lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o ra la atu iyi ogomineti, kaa la ki ŋɔ mu oloto la egbo mɛzhi kaa la ki gbo Ukpo ɔya mu egbo ikpɛnyi akwɛyi ki wo kiya ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a gyi. <verse eid="1TI 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 2:3" />Iwomo ɛlɛ te ishoshi, akwu kiya ingyi ki shela Ukpo Edego-ala usama nzu, <verse eid="1TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 2:4" />uwu bɔkɔ akwu mu igyima wu te uwewe la fya isama kaa le yitu iyi ongbulolo. <verse eid="1TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 2:5" />Moo kinzu ki yitu te Ukpo akwu ukpɛnyi, u ri meka uwu Ukpo mbala enzu akwu ukpɛnyi, uwu gba a kwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi le, <verse eid="1TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 2:6" />uwu bɔkɔ a ra la ɛnwu e shi kaa lo ngbɛ wu ma kaa uwewe la fya isama. Ukpo a zɔ nzu ɛlɛ mu kwuye yi. <verse eid="1TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 2:7" />Akwu kwuwongu ɛlɛ gba Ukpo a ŋa mi te la mi kwu uzilɔ mbala u tanu uwu rɛnu wu le. Iso iyi mi so yi ele akwu iso iyi ongbulolo, akwiyi imulo mo. Imi mi kwu u zɔ ɛzu uwu iso iyi ongbulolo la enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu Azhu mo.<verse eid="1TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 2:8" />Kwuwo kwɔlɛ, mi gyi te anzɔnu munamuna, luzɛ mba mu idu iyi Ukpo lakwu undu ɔpɛriri dɛ gba o yi ewo mbo mo moshi mu Ukpo ilɛma ma le, lakwu enzu umba amba naa enzu umba kaambu irimo mo.<verse eid="1TI 2:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 2:9" />Mi gyi te eko tete lo se ekpayi ɔnyɛnyɛ, iyi bɔkɔ i fa mamba akwɛyi ii shi enzu o lo mbo mo, akwu inyi ishimo iyi ari iwomo mo naa egolu ilomo naa esepo iyi alu naa ekpayi iyi abwa gyɔɔ mo. <verse eid="1TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 2:10" />Eko lakwu umba bɔkɔ oo wo ɛduma iyeshi mu idu iyi enzu, ɛlɛ gba ishoshi te lakwu iwomo iyi eko umba bɔkɔ akwu ɛmɛ umba Ukpo le.<verse eid="1TI 2:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 2:11" />Oko uwunawuna la ŋɔma kyoo la ngbɛ alu, la gba le lomo la onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yewu mu ɛzu izɔma. <verse eid="1TI 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 2:12" />Mi shi kapa la oko te la zɔ ɛzu mo nana lakwu u to keyi uwu anzɔnu mo. Eko lo kpala kenzu mo. <verse eid="1TI 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 2:13" />Moo Ukpo e wo Adɛmu keyi dɛ gba e bo wo Ivu le. <verse eid="1TI 2:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 2:14" />Kuyi ungopo gba akwu te, onzu uwoyi e kyoro Adɛmu ma mo, akwu Ivu gba e kyoro wu mo le akwɛyi akwu onzu uwu ingbomo. <verse eid="1TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 2:15" />Eko ba o fya isama mbaa Ukpo kwuwongu ɛmɛ imbama akwiyi gba o lafya la Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma mbala idɛnyi iyi enzu ipumo, mbala iŋɔma iyi ɔpɛriri mbala luzɛ undu esheshi mo.<verse eid="1TI 2:15" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="1TI 3" />
  <para style="s1">Ari Iyi Watokeyi Umba Ɔshɔshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 3:1" />Ongbulolo uwu iso e yi te mɛɛ: Gba onzu a gyi te lakwu utokeyi uwu ɔshɔshi de, a mulɛ ɛduma iyesheshi. <verse eid="1TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 3:2" />Utokeyi uwu ɔshɔshi lakwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ oo la wu kenzu mɛnwu mo, lakwu ɔnzɔnu uwu bɔkɔ e yi oko ukpɛnyi, lakwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e wo amba efyefya mo, e yi ɛnwu wu kwuwo, enzu o lo wu mo, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a mwɔnyɛ iyi agboga inama, onzu uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ kiya ego, <verse eid="1TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 3:3" />lakwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to ɛnwu wu a ta la atɛ iwomo mo, lakwu onzu uwu anu mo, uwu ba lakwu onzu uwu egbo, lakwu onzu uri lɔɔmbu mo, lakwu ugyi eduwo mo. <verse eid="1TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 3:4" />Lakwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a bɔ eyi mu enzu umba kwogba wu marimari bɔkɔ ɛmɛ wu o lo wu mo ba oo mbwalu iso wu. <verse eid="1TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 3:5" />(Gba onzu a bɔ eyi mu enzu umba kwogba wu ego mo, i zɛ te bɔkɔ a bɔ eyi mu ɔshɔshi uwu Ukpo ego? <verse eid="1TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 3:6" />La akwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ a na iso iyi Ukpo iyepo mo. Moo, ɛlɛ i shi wu e fulo ɛnwu mu kadu, akwɛyi Ukpo e lo wu inyashi kyamate bɔkɔ e lo onzu uwoyi inyashi tayi. <verse eid="1TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 3:7" />Lakwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi ɛnyi iyeshi mbaa enzu umba bɔkɔ akwu wa mbwalu mo, kwuwongu kaa lo lowu eseye mo, kaa ba le fye mu kwuda ungwu onzu uwoyi mo.<verse eid="1TI 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Enzu Wambwama Mu Ɛduma Mu Ɔshɔshi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 3:8" />Uwo ɛduma mu ɔshɔshi tete lakwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi egbo iyeshi, lakwu onzu ongbulolo, lakwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e to ɛnwu a ta la atɛ iwomo mo, ba lakwu uwo kwupapa ungwu eduwo mo, <verse eid="1TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 3:9" />lakwu enzu umba bɔkɔ o rala ongbulolo uwu iso iyi Ukpo laa egbo ikpɛnyi. <verse eid="1TI 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 3:10" />Lo pwa mba ma keyi dɛ, gba o ma ira ikpikpɛnyi te munyi mbo mo, ba lo shi mbo lo so wu mu ɛduma iyi Ukpo iwomo.<verse eid="1TI 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 3:11" />Tatayi gba eko mbo lo yi le tete, lo kwu eko umba o yi egbo iyeshi, la kwu eko umba ikyɛma mo, umba ba la kwu enzu umba egbo mɛzhi bɔkɔ enzu o fulo egbo mamba mu kiya ingyinangyina.<verse eid="1TI 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 3:12" />Uwo ɛduma mu ɔshɔshi la kwu onzu uwu bɔkɔ e yi oko ukpɛnyi, bɔkɔ e do te a bɔ eyi mu ɛmɛ wu mbala enzu umba kwogba wu marimari. <verse eid="1TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 3:13" />Wa wo ɛduma mu ɔshɔshi umba bɔkɔ o wo marimari awu enzu o lo mbo mo gyɔɔ akwɛyi o yi kenzu unga iso isomo mu opwu uwɔkwu mbaa enzu meka iyi ikwu idu ifulo mbo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi.<verse eid="1TI 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kwunvyeru Ungwɔkwu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 3:14" />Mi gyi te la mi bo munyi ŋɔ afyi ɛlɛ, tetete mi ka ŋa kwupwu kwɔlɛ dɛɛ, <verse eid="1TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 3:15" />gba mi bo efya mo, kwupwu kwɔlɛ lakwu shi ŋɔ kaa yitu iyi bɔkɔ enzu lo wo mu ugu uwu Ukpo, uwu bɔkɔ akwu ɔshɔshi uwu Ukpo uwu bɔkɔ e yi lareyi, inyi gba akwu ope mbala ɔla uwu bɔkɔ u rala ongbulolo le. <verse eid="1TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 3:16" />Onzu ukpɛnyi te e do te e ri kambwu te iso iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo a wu yi a ta nzu awu akwu i yi kenzu iyama mo:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">e to ɛnwu iyi onzu,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">O zɔ wu te akwu ongbulolo,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">Alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo o ma wu.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">O tanu iyi ilɔ iyesheshi wu la enzu munamuna,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="1TI 3:16">O kwidu o fulo mawu munamuna mu kwudu kwɔlɛ.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="1TI 3:16">O to wu mo o kawa moshi.<verse eid="1TI 3:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="1TI 4" />
  <para style="s1">Ɔpɔlu A Za La Otimoti Te La Ngbɛdu Mbaa Wa Zɔ Ɛzu Iyi angba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 4:1" />Kwundu uwu Ukpo e so gedegede te, kwuyengwu imbwama enzu umbafo o lafya laa iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi imbwaluma akwɛyi o mbwalu ɛndu iyi kwukyoro mbala ɛzɔ iyi eyo umbeyi. <verse eid="1TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 4:2" />Wa zɔ ɛzu ɛlɛ o wo kyamate umba o yi mu ongbulolo izɔma tayi, umba ba o yi mu imulo imuma, idu mba inzhirima kyamate onzu uwu bɔkɔ o ki wu kwoso ungwɔyi tayi. <verse eid="1TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 4:3" />O zɔ enzu te ishoshi te, ɔnzɔnu le to oko mo, okokpayi ba la ya ɔnu mo. O zɔ enzu te lo ri ewiri iyifo mo. Ewiri ɛlɛ ba Ukpo e wo yi kaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o mbwalu ongbulolo uwu iso iyi Ɔzhizɔsi lo ri la ɛnyi igbɛlɛma. <verse eid="1TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 4:4" />Moo kiya ingyinangyina ingyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e wo ki shoshi. Lo towo Kiya ingyinangyina ma mo, kiya ingyinangyina ba lo na ngyi ma laa ɛnyi igbɛlɛma, <verse eid="1TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 4:5" />kwuwongu iso iyi Ukpo mbala Ukpo ilɛma i shi ewiri ɛnyi i wuluma mbaa Ukpo.<verse eid="1TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Umɛgba Uwesheshi Uwu Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 4:6" />Gba ŋɔ zɔ wa mbwalu apula ɛlɛ lɛɛbi, ŋɔɔ kwu umɛgba uwu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi uwu esheshi uwu bɔkɔ o yi wu o domo mu ongbulolo uwu ikwu idu lu fulo mu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi mbala ɛzɔ wu iyesheshi iyi bɔkɔ ŋɔ mbwalu awu. <verse eid="1TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 4:7" />Uŋɔ zɛ gboo mbaa iso iyi umbwa iyi bɔkɔ i du Ukpo ma mo. Uŋɔ ba zɔ ɛŋɔ ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo. <verse eid="1TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 4:8" />Ɛnɛ inɛma kaa ɛnwu li fya ekpasu ma ishoshi, ɛduma iyi Ukpo ba ishoshi i ka le, kwuwogwu inyi gba imbwa la onzu ma le kwuyengwu e ye la reyi mbala kwuyengwu kwu yi mu inyɔma.<verse eid="1TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 4:9" />Ɛlɛ gba akwu ongbulolo uwu iso le, uwewe la nya yi ma. <verse eid="1TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 4:10" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ gba ki wo ɛduma iyɛkɔkɔ le, kwuwongu ki fulo egbo nzu mu Ukpo ureyi, uwu bɔkɔ akwu usama uwu enzu lɛɛbi, mbala umba bɔkɔ o kwidu o fulo ma wu shɛshɛ awu.<verse eid="1TI 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 4:11" />So mbo iso ɛlɛ mbala ɛzɔ ɛlɛ. <verse eid="1TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 4:12" />Uŋɔ ki shi onzu uwunawuna la zhi ŋɔ ma kwuwongu imɛshɛri ŋɔ mo. Uŋɔ ba kwu u mbwalu uwu bɔkɔ enzu o mondo wu mu iso ŋɔ, luzɛ ŋɔ, idɛnyi ipwumo ŋɔ, ikwu idu fulo ŋɔ mbala ɔpɛriri ŋɔ. <verse eid="1TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 4:13" />Gyakpɔɔ mu iso iyi Ukpo iwama gedegede mbala anu itama, mbala ɛzu izɔma nzhii ba la mi bi bo. <verse eid="1TI 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 4:14" />Uŋɔ ki zhi rɛshi ingyi kwundu ingyi bɔkɔ ki yi ma ŋa awu ma mo, ingyi bɔkɔ o shi ŋɔ kwuyengwu anukenzu o so iso akwɛyi watokeyi umba ɔshɔshi o fulo ŋɔ ewo mu reshi awu mo.<verse eid="1TI 4:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 4:15" />Ra la ɛŋɔ kaa shi apula ɛlɛ kaa enzu lɛɛbi lo ma i shekeyi ŋɔ. <verse eid="1TI 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 4:16" />Bɔ eyi mu luzɛ ŋɔ mbala ɛzɔ ŋɔ. Gyakpɔɔ mu apula ɛlɛ iwomo, kwuwongu gba ŋɔ wo yi, ŋɔ sa ɛŋɔ ma mbala enzu umba bɔkɔ o pwa ŋa.<verse eid="1TI 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="1TI 5" />
  <para style="s">Ɔpɔlu A Ta Amasa La Otimoti Ewo Iyi Bɔkɔ E Wo Mbala Wambwalu Lɛɛbi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 5:1" />Uŋɔ ki kpa onzu uwakɔ ɛyi zhazha mo, uŋɔ ba so wu iso kyamate akwu ada ŋa tayi. Akolobiya ba wo mbo mate akwu ɛmɛnɛ ŋɔ tayi, <verse eid="1TI 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 5:2" />enzu umbakɔ ekokpayi wo mbo kyamate umbɛnɛ ŋɔ tayi, emesheko ba wo mbo kyamate ɛmɛnɛ ŋɔ ekokpayi tayi la egbo iruwu.<verse eid="1TI 5:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 5:3" />Bɔ eyi mu eko wa kpo anuma umba bɔkɔ ugɔ a kpamba ma awu marimari. <verse eid="1TI 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 5:4" />Akwiyi gba oko uwu bɔkɔ e kpo ɔnu ma ba e yi ɛmɛ naa eye, umba mbɔlɛ lo zɔ te o kwu wa mbwalu Ukpo mu eyi ibɔma mu enzu mbo keyi dɛ, mu iwomo ɛlɛ te umba o wa kwokpa la enzu umba kwogba mba, moo Ukpo a gyi ɛlɛ te. <verse eid="1TI 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 5:5" />Oko u kpo ɔnu ma uwu bɔkɔ ugɔ akpa wu ma akwu uwu bɔkɔ e yi enzu fo, uwu ba e shi egbo wu mu Ukpo ba a lɛ Ukpo lutu lɔnu kaa Ukpo la mbwa wu ma. <verse eid="1TI 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 5:6" />Oko u kpo ɔnu ma uwu bɔkɔ a ŋɔ ya wu mu ugyɔ uwu kwudu irimo, e yi la reyi le bi mo akwu ukpɛzhi. <verse eid="1TI 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 5:7" />Enzu mbamba ta mba kaza kɛlɛ tete kaa enzu umbafo mba lo fya mbaa bɔkɔ o bɔ mba kenzu mɛnwu mo. <verse eid="1TI 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 5:8" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a bɔ enzu wu eyi mo, ba iyi agba wu i ka le mo, onzu awu a mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi fo onzu awu a ka rigɔ la onzu uwu akwu u mbwalu mo.<verse eid="1TI 5:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 5:9" />Oko u kpo ɔnu ma uwu bɔkɔ lɔri wu lu pika lɔri uwo ɛkpɛrɛnyi ma mo, uwu bɔkɔ a ya ɔnu ukpɛnyi mo lo ka ɛnyi wu ma mo. <verse eid="1TI 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 5:10" />Oko ele te lo yitu wu te ee wo ɛduma iyi esheshi kyamate, ɛmɛ iyimo, agboga inama, a gbɔ atakɛzhi iyi wa mbwalu ma, aa mbwama la enzu umba inyashi, e kyo a ra la ɛnwu e shi la ɛduma iyeshi iwomo.<verse eid="1TI 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 5:11" />Eko wa kpo anuma ɛmɛshɛri ki ka ɛnyi mba ma mo, moo kwuyengwu bɔkɔ ekweyi iyi ɛnwu i bi ga mba ma akwɛyi o bɔ idu mu Okrasi fo, o gyi te o ya anu ŋa, <verse eid="1TI 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 5:12" />Gba o wo ɛlɛ te Ukpo e lo mbo inyashi, moo iyi bɔkɔ umba o so te o wo awu, o wo yi mo. <verse eid="1TI 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 5:13" />I kyo kadu iyi ɛlɛ, o fye mu iŋɔma shaa akwɛyi o kpɛvyɛ magba magba; O vindɔ wa fembu tete, o lo kenzu mu iso iyi bɔkɔ akwu iya mba mo, iso iyi bɔkɔ akwiyi so mo gba o so le. <verse eid="1TI 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 5:14" />Kwuwongwu ɔlɛ eko wa kpo anuma ɛmɛshɛri mi ta mba amasa te, lo ya anu lo mba ɛmɛ, kaa lo bɔ eyi mu agba mba kaa enzu umbeyi lo fya kapa iyi o so iyira mba mo. <verse eid="1TI 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 5:15" />Moo umbafo o shi Ukpo ɔsu-a, akwɛyi o mbwalu onzu uwoyi ŋa.<verse eid="1TI 5:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 5:16" />Okokpayi uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ akwu u mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ e yi eko wakpanuma mogba wu, la mbwa mba ma, moo lo fulo ɔshɔshi ewulo mo, kaa ɔshɔshi la mbwama laa eko wakpanuma umba bɔkɔ ugɔ akpa mba ma shɛ awu.<verse eid="1TI 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 5:17" />Enzumbakɔ umba bɔkɔ o bɔ eyi mu ɛshɔshi marimari awu la lu lo mbo mo gyɔɔ, umba bɔkɔ ɛduma mba akwu anu itama mbala kiya izɔma awu, ilomo mbo mbala imbwama mba li ka le. <verse eid="1TI 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 5:18" />Moo kwokpo ungwu Ukpo kwu zɔ te, &lt;&lt;Endo uwu bɔkɔ e yi mu awa ilɔma lo ma wu kenzu ma mo. Onzu uwu ɛduma ba e do rigbɛ wu ma.&gt;&gt; <verse eid="1TI 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 5:19" />Uŋɔ ki na ombu uwu bɔkɔ o fu o lo onzu uwakɔ bi mo, azɔgɔ lo yi wepo naa wala dɛ. <verse eid="1TI 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 5:20" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o ngbomo, lo tu mbo mo leyi iyi enzu gedegede kaa enzu umba bɔkɔ o shimo lo riyi.<verse eid="1TI 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 5:21" />Kwuwongwu Ukpo mbala Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi mbala alɔgbulɔ umba Ukpo umba bɔkɔ a ŋa mba awu, mi kpa ŋa ɛshɛku te bɔ eyi mu kaza kɛlɛ, ki zɔ kusɛ mo ba ki zɔ iyitu iyi onzu meyi mo.<verse eid="1TI 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="1TI 5:22" />Uŋɔ ki fulo onzu kwuwo kpara mo, ki kyo mu ingbomo iyi enzu umbafo mo. Uŋɔ ba zɛ gboo mbaa ingbomo.<verse eid="1TI 5:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="1TI 5:23" />Uŋɔ ki wo embyi umba uta kɛɛkyi fo, wo embyi umba imuma iyi uwɛyi uwu owanyi bwɛ. Kwuwongwu ubu ɛnyi ŋɔ mbala efya wɔwɔ ɛnyi.<verse eid="1TI 5:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="1TI 5:24" />Ingbomo iyi enzu umbafo invyemo mo, i to mbo keshi keyi nzhii ba mu riyi ingyi ombu; iyi enzu umbafo ba i mbwalu mba kembo. <verse eid="1TI 5:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="1TI 5:25" />Tatayi ɛduma iyeshi i nvyemo mo, iyi bɔkɔ akwu iyeshi mo ba i nvyemo mo tete.<verse eid="1TI 5:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="1TI 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="1TI 6:1" />Enzu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi lɛɛbi umba bɔkɔ o kwu enye, lo lomo la ada umba kwogba mba ma kaa enzu lo zhi ɛnyi iyi Ukpo Edego-ala ma mo, kaa lɔ zɔ te ɛzu iyi ki zɔ le, akwu iso iyira mo. <verse eid="1TI 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="1TI 6:2" />Enye umba bɔkɔ ada umba kwogba mba o kwu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi, lɔ zhi mba ma kwuwongu o kwu wa mbwalu kyakya mo. Umba lala ifate lo gbo mbo rinye ɔnyɛ li kaa le kwuwongu ada umba kwogba mba o kwu wa mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi mbala mba tete, o gba o pwu idɛnyi mbo kpɔ.</para>
  <para style="s" vid="1TI 6:2">Ɛzɔ Iyi Angba Mbala Ɛzɔ Iyi Imulo</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:2">Apula ɛlɛ gba ŋɔ zɔ mba kaa lɔ mbwalu le.<verse eid="1TI 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="1TI 6:3" />Onzu uwunawuna uwu bɔkɔ a zɔ enzu ɛzu iyi angba iyi bɔkɔ i zɛ kya mbala iso iyi Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi e so mo, mbala iso iyi bɔkɔ i shi enzu kaa lɔ zɛ luzɛ undu lu she la Ukpo mo, <verse eid="1TI 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="1TI 6:4" />onzu awu tayi e kwu ɛnwu le bi moo e yi kiya kinyinyi mo. Obe uwu onzu awu tayi gba akwu lɔmbwu irimo mbala itumo iyi bɔkɔ i bo la rise iwomo mbala ovyo iwomo, mbala iso iyi amba, mbala eyi ibɔma iyira mu onzu <verse eid="1TI 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="1TI 6:5" />mbala ovyo iwomo mbala esu ngbɛɛ. Egbo iyi enzu mbamba tayi i sheshi fo. Umba o do te ɔ zɔngɔma ongbulolo ma fo. Umba o mamate imbwalu Ukpo akwu ɔgwuzɛ uwu eduwo ifyama.<verse eid="1TI 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="1TI 6:6" />Ukpo imbwalu ma mbala ingbede kwuwongu kiya ingyi Ukpo e shi ŋɔ, gba akwu kule ungwɔkwu le. <verse eid="1TI 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="1TI 6:7" />Moo ki bo la kiya kinyinyi mu kwudu kwɔlɛ mo, kinzu ba ki to kiya kinyinyi mangwu mo. <verse eid="1TI 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="1TI 6:8" />Kwuwo kwɔngu, gba ki yi kiya ingyirimo mbala ekpayi iyi isemo, la ki ngbede la Ukpo. <verse eid="1TI 6:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="1TI 6:9" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o gyi kpɔɔ te lo yi kiya ingyi kwuwo, gba ipwama idu mbo bwɛɛ, ɔ kɔ mu itama mo. O fye mu kwuda ungwu apula iyira iwomo iyi erendo mbala iyi bɔkɔ i lo mbo mu kumbɛ ungwu lukwu. <verse eid="1TI 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="1TI 6:10" />Moo ikpolukwu undu eduwo gba akwu undu uwu ira iyinayina le. Enzu umbafo umba bɔkɔ o gyi kpɔɔ te lo yi eduwo, o lafyima la ɔgwuzɛ uwu Ukpo imbwaluma akwɛyi o ka la ɛmba la ubugyi gyɔɔ.<verse eid="1TI 6:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Iso Imbwambwa Iyi Ɔpɔlu E So Otimoti.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="1TI 6:11" />Otimoti, uŋɔ ba ŋɔ kwu uwu Ukpo awu, zɛ gboo mbaa ɛlɛ te lɛɛbi. Gyakpɔɔ kaa mbwalu ototo, idu iyi Ukpo, ikwu idu fulo, idɛnyi, idukwɔku, iyi kyoo. <verse eid="1TI 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="1TI 6:12" />Uŋɔ kiri ewa kaa ra la ikwu idu fulo ŋɔ mu Ukpo ngiri. Ka fya kwunyɔ ungwɔkpɔ ngwu Ukpo e shi ŋɔ kwuye ungwu o ya ŋa ma akwɛyi ŋɔ so gedegede leyi iyenzu guruguru te ŋɔ mbwalu Ɔzhizɔsi ŋa awu, rangwu kpakiri. <verse eid="1TI 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="1TI 6:13" />Imi mi ta ŋa ɔkpa mu idu iyi Ukpo Edego-ala u shi kiya ingyinangyinakwunyɔ awu, mbala Okrasi Ɔzhizɔsi uwu bɔkɔ e to izɔgɔ iyesheshi midu iyi Ɔpɔtiyɔ Opayileti awu, te <verse eid="1TI 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="1TI 6:14" />mbwalu apula iyi bɔkɔ o so ŋɔ lɛɛbi kyorikyori, kaa onzu uwufo la fya ɔgwuzɛ uwu e shi ŋɔ kwungbɛ mo nzhii ba kwuyengwu Ɔkwu nzu Ɔzhizɔsi Okrasi a ba gbama. <verse eid="1TI 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="1TI 6:15" />Edego-ala, Ɔsu uwu Asu, Ɔkwu uwu Akwu, uwu mafyi wu gba aa zɔ kwuyengwu ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i bi wo le. <verse eid="1TI 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="1TI 6:16" />Iduma mbala ekpasu lɛɛbi akwiyi Edego-ala uwu bɔkɔ uwu kɛɛkyi gba e kpomo mo le, uwu bɔkɔ ɛbɛ iyɛku i fula wu ma iyi bɔkɔ onzu e do te e re kɛlɛ mbawu mo, uwu bɔkɔ onzu uwunawuna a da ma wu dɛ mo, ba onzu e do te a ma wu mo iyɔkpɔɔ. Li yi tayi.<verse eid="1TI 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="1TI 6:17" />Enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi kwuwo mu kwudu kwɔlɛ awu, ta mba ɔkpa te lo kwu ɛnwu mo ba lo fulo egbo mbo lɛɛbi mu kiya ingyi kwuwo mbo mo, moo ɛlɛ lɛɛbi i yi iyɔkpɔɔ mo. So mbo kaa lo fulo egbo mbo lɛɛbi mu Ukpo Edego-ala, moo uwu gba e shi nzu kiya ingyinangyina kaa la ki mwɔnyɛ le. <verse eid="1TI 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="1TI 6:18" />Ta mba ɔkpa kaa lo mbwama la enzu umba bɔkɔ o yi igɔ, lo wo ɛduma iyeshi la enzu, lo nyi kwunyi mo, lo wo rɛshi mu egbo mbo lɛɛbi. <verse eid="1TI 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="1TI 6:19" />Gba o wo tayi, o kpala ɛmba kiya ingyi kwuwo ingyɛkwuu moshi ingyi bɔkɔ aa kwamba ɔla uwu ɛkɔ ɔnuwu kwɔnyi kwɔlɛ la ɔnyɛ imwuma.<verse eid="1TI 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="1TI 6:20" />Otimoti, rima ngiri kaa wo ɛduma iyi bɔkɔ Ukpo e shi ŋɔ te wo. Ki shi alu mbaa iso iyira iyi umbwa iyi bɔkɔ enzu umbafo o so, ba i zɛ kya mbala ongbulolo uwu Ukpo mo. Enzu mbamba tayi, o to yi te ɛlɛ akwu iyitu, tetete, ɛlɛ akwu iyitu mo ndii. <verse eid="1TI 6:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="1TI 6:21" />Enzu umbafo ɔ mbwalu iso iyira ɛlɛ; gba i shi o lafya la ɔgwuzɛ ongbulolo uwu Okrasi le.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="1TI 6:21">Esheshi li yi mbala yi lɛɛbi. l<verse eid="1TI 6:21" /></para>
  <chapter eid="1TI 6" />
</usx>